-- 0111 · نصوص الموقع — THE SITE'S OWN WORDS LEAVE THE CODE.
--
-- Generated from the extraction of every visitor-facing string in src/ (0109's multi-language work, owner
-- 2026-10-03: «النصوص ما تكونش مكتوبة مباشرة في الكود»). Each row is the exact Arabic the page printed until
-- now, so the Arabic site reads the same before and after; label_ar and description_ar say where it appears,
-- for the translation room in the Back Office (/admin/settings/translations).
--
-- `on conflict do nothing`: a row the owner already edited is never overwritten. Keys are `ui.<area>.<name>`,
-- plus a few site.* keys the code used to carry only as a fallback. `npm run i18n:check` proves that every
-- key the code reads exists here.

on conflict (key) do nothing;

-- Settings the public pages now read through the site's configuration, which only loads public rows.
update public.settings set is_public = true where key in ('journey.unknown_label');
